d from 809708f3-1c5f-4e37-ad6a-8bcbae408799 to b3700c9c-6560-42e1-a401-7d784574dba9, and system, networking, configuration checksum, and hardened kernel values recovered. Fixed lifecycle observations independently confirm the boot transition and healthy post-executor services.","limitations":["Package-manager consistency checks timed out both before and after execution, so package health could not be independently assessed.","The node has no task-defined application data or cluster state to test; restart recovery evidence therefore covers system health, network reachability, persistent configuration, kernel values, and baseline services."]}
